WEBVTT

00:07:29.664 --> 00:07:30.871
my own circle of friends,

00:07:30.895 --> 00:07:32.865
not for the people I hate, not for them."

00:07:32.889 --> 00:07:34.078
It doesn't work.

00:07:34.102 --> 00:07:36.437
It's a terrible strategy, it doesn't work,

00:07:36.461 --> 00:07:38.095
but that's what we keep doing.

00:07:38.119 --> 00:07:39.929
I see it every single day.

00:07:39.953 --> 00:07:43.339
These silos are just getting stronger.

00:07:43.363 --> 00:07:44.804
And you know,

00:07:44.828 --> 00:07:46.670
your corner of the internet,

00:07:46.694 --> 00:07:48.536
like Instagram or Twitter,

00:07:48.560 --> 00:07:51.021
we're just in an echo chamber
talking to each other.

00:07:51.045 --> 00:07:55.012
So I can be really comfortable in my
Berkeley Democratic Socialist commons

00:07:55.036 --> 00:07:56.420
and talk to all of you.

00:07:56.444 --> 00:08:00.466
And my dad can be in his bootstrappy
immigrant Republican commons,